; rule: JVMS 4.10: type checking from version 50
; expect: java.lang.VerifyError
; reason: no stack map frame
; oracle: differs, version 50 may fail over to the inference verifier, which LazyVM does not have (decisions.md D1)
class Bad
version 50
method public static main ([Ljava/lang/String;)V stack 1 locals 1
iconst_0
ifeq L
L:
return
end
